            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-25990",
              "name": "LanguageSpecificPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "pillow: Pillow: Out-of-bounds Write via Specially Crafted PSD Image"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Pillow is a Python imaging library. From 10.3.0 to before 12.1.1, an out-of-bounds write may be triggered when loading a specially crafted PSD image. This vulnerability is fixed in 12.1.1."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-25990",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-25990\nSeverity: HIGH\nPackage: pillow\nFixed Version: 12.1.1\nLink: [CVE-2026-25990](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-25990)\nPillow is a Python imaging library. From 10.3.0 to before 12.1.1, an out-of-bounds write may be triggered when loading a specially crafted PSD image. This vulnerability is fixed in 12.1.1.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-25990**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|HIGH|pillow|12.1.1|[CVE-2026-25990](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-25990)|\n\nPillow is a Python imaging library. From 10.3.0 to before 12.1.1, an out-of-bounds write may be triggered when loading a specially crafted PSD image. This vulnerability is fixed in 12.1.1."
              },
              "properties": {
                "cvssv40_baseScore": 8.6,
                "cvssv40_vector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N",
