            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-59200",
              "name": "LanguageSpecificPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Pillow: Pillow: Denial of service via crafted PDF stream"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Pillow is a Python imaging library. From 5.1.0 until 12.3.0, PdfParser.PdfStream.decode() in PIL/PdfParser.py calls zlib.decompress() with bufsize set to the PDF stream Length field without bounding the decompressed output size, allowing a crafted FlateDecode PDF stream to exhaust memory from a small file. This issue is fixed in version 12.3.0."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-59200",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-59200\nSeverity: HIGH\nPackage: pillow\nFixed Version: 12.3.0\nLink: [CVE-2026-59200](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-59200)\nPillow is a Python imaging library. From 5.1.0 until 12.3.0, PdfParser.PdfStream.decode() in PIL/PdfParser.py calls zlib.decompress() with bufsize set to the PDF stream Length field without bounding the decompressed output size, allowing a crafted FlateDecode PDF stream to exhaust memory from a small file. This issue is fixed in version 12.3.0.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-59200**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|HIGH|pillow|12.3.0|[CVE-2026-59200](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-59200)|\n\nPillow is a Python imaging library. From 5.1.0 until 12.3.0, PdfParser.PdfStream.decode() in PIL/PdfParser.py calls zlib.decompress() with bufsize set to the PDF stream Length field without bounding the decompressed output size, allowing a crafted FlateDecode PDF stream to exhaust memory from a small file. This issue is fixed in version 12.3.0."
              },
