            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-10804",
              "name": "LanguageSpecificPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "streamlit: Streamlit: Weak hash usage leading to low integrity and availability impact"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A vulnerability has been found in Streamlit up to 1.53.0. Impacted is an unknown function in the library lib/streamlit/runtime/caching/hashing.py of the component Palette Handler. Such manipulation leads to use of weak hash. Local access is required to approach this attack. The attack requires a high level of complexity. The exploitability is considered difficult. The exploit has been disclosed to the public and may be used. The pull request to fix this issue awaits acceptance."
              },
